{"id":189,"slug":"189-cach-toi-uu-cumulative-layout-shift-cls","category":"CSS","subcategory":"Performance","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Cách tối ưu Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)?","question_en":"How do you optimize Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS)?","answer_vi":"CLS đo mức **nội dung bị xê dịch ngoài ý muốn** trong lúc trang tải. Ngưỡng tốt: **≤ 0.1**.\n\nBốn nguồn gây dịch chuyển, xử lý theo thứ tự tác động:\n\n**1. Ảnh và video không có kích thước** — nguyên nhân phổ biến nhất.\n\n```html\n<img src=\"/hero.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\">   <!-- browser giữ chỗ theo tỉ lệ -->\n```\n\n```css\n.media { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; width: 100%; height: auto; }\n```\n\n**2. Nội dung chèn động** — banner, quảng cáo, khung nhúng.\n\n```css\n.ad-slot { min-height: 250px; }   /* giữ chỗ trước, đừng để nó đẩy nội dung */\n```\n\n**3. Web font đổi kích thước chữ.**\n\n```css\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\n  src: url('/fonts/bvp.woff2') format('woff2');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 100%;      /* căn metric với font dự phòng */\n}\n```\n\n**4. Chèn nội dung phía trên vùng đang đọc** — thông báo, thanh cookie xuất hiện muộn đẩy cả trang xuống. Nếu bắt buộc phải có, dùng overlay `position: fixed` thay vì chèn thẳng vào normal flow.\n\n**Lưu ý:** CLS **không chỉ đo lúc tải**. Google tính cả dịch chuyển xảy ra sau tương tác (trừ 500ms ngay sau input của người dùng). Accordion mở ra đẩy nội dung là hợp lệ; nhưng một khối tự bung sau 3 giây thì bị tính.\n\n**Đo:** Lighthouse cho dữ liệu lab, `web-vitals` + Search Console cho dữ liệu người dùng thật — hai con số này thường lệch nhau khá nhiều","answer_en":"CLS measures how much **content moves unexpectedly** while a page loads. The good threshold is **0.1 or below**.\n\nFour sources of movement, in order of impact:\n\n**1. Images and video without dimensions** — the most common cause.\n\n```html\n<img src=\"/hero.jpg\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" alt=\"\">   <!-- the browser reserves the ratio -->\n```\n\n```css\n.media { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; width: 100%; height: auto; }\n```\n\n**2. Dynamically inserted content** — banners, ads, embeds.\n\n```css\n.ad-slot { min-height: 250px; }   /* reserve the space instead of pushing content */\n```\n\n**3. Web fonts changing text metrics.**\n\n```css\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\n  src: url('/fonts/bvp.woff2') format('woff2');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 100%;      /* align metrics with the fallback */\n}\n```\n\n**4. Content injected above the reading position** — a late notification or cookie bar pushing the page down. When one is unavoidable, use a `position: fixed` overlay rather than inserting into the flow.\n\n**Note:** CLS **is not measured only during load**. Google counts shifts after interaction too (excluding the 500ms window right after user input). An accordion expanding is fine; a block that pops open on its own after three seconds is counted.\n\n**Measuring:** Lighthouse for the lab, `web-vitals` plus Search Console for field data — the two numbers often differ noticeably","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">CLS đo mức <strong>nội dung bị xê dịch ngoài ý muốn</strong> trong lúc trang tải. Ngưỡng tốt: <strong>≤ 0.1</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Bốn nguồn gây dịch chuyển, xử lý theo thứ tự tác động:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. Ảnh và video không có kích thước</strong> — nguyên nhân phổ biến nhất.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;img src=&quot;/hero.jpg&quot; width=&quot;1200&quot; height=&quot;630&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;   &lt;!-- browser giữ chỗ theo tỉ lệ --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">width</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1200&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">height</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;630&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>&gt;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- browser giữ chỗ theo tỉ lệ --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".media { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; width: 100%; height: auto; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.media</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">aspect-ratio</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">16</span> / <span class=\"hljs-number\">9</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">height</span>: auto; }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">**2.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Nội dung chèn động** — banner, quảng cáo, khung nhúng.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".ad-slot { min-height: 250px; }   /* giữ chỗ trước, đừng để nó đẩy nội dung */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.ad-slot</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-height</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">250px</span>; }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* giữ chỗ trước, đừng để nó đẩy nội dung */</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">**3.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Web font đổi kích thước chữ.**</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\n  src: url('/fonts/bvp.woff2') format('woff2');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 100%;      /* căn metric với font dự phòng */\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@font-face</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Be Vietnam Pro&#x27;</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">src</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">url</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/fonts/bvp.woff2&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">format</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;woff2&#x27;</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-display</span>: swap;\n  size-adjust: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>;      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* căn metric với font dự phòng */</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>4. Chèn nội dung phía trên vùng đang đọc</strong> — thông báo, thanh cookie xuất hiện muộn đẩy cả trang xuống. Nếu bắt buộc phải có, dùng overlay <code>position: fixed</code> thay vì chèn thẳng vào normal flow.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> CLS <strong>không chỉ đo lúc tải</strong>. Google tính cả dịch chuyển xảy ra sau tương tác (trừ 500ms ngay sau input của người dùng). Accordion mở ra đẩy nội dung là hợp lệ; nhưng một khối tự bung sau 3 giây thì bị tính.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Đo:</strong> Lighthouse cho dữ liệu lab, <code>web-vitals</code> + Search Console cho dữ liệu người dùng thật — hai con số này thường lệch nhau khá nhiều.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">CLS measures how much <strong>content moves unexpectedly</strong> while a page loads. The good threshold is <strong>0.1 or below</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Four sources of movement, in order of impact:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. Images and video without dimensions</strong> — the most common cause.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;img src=&quot;/hero.jpg&quot; width=&quot;1200&quot; height=&quot;630&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;   &lt;!-- the browser reserves the ratio --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/hero.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">width</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1200&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">height</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;630&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>&gt;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- the browser reserves the ratio --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".media { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; width: 100%; height: auto; }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.media</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">aspect-ratio</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">16</span> / <span class=\"hljs-number\">9</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>; <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">height</span>: auto; }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">**2.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Dynamically inserted content** — banners, ads, embeds.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".ad-slot { min-height: 250px; }   /* reserve the space instead of pushing content */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.ad-slot</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">min-height</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">250px</span>; }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* reserve the space instead of pushing content */</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">**3.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Web fonts changing text metrics.**</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\n  src: url('/fonts/bvp.woff2') format('woff2');\n  font-display: swap;\n  size-adjust: 100%;      /* align metrics with the fallback */\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">@font-face</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Be Vietnam Pro&#x27;</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">src</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">url</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/fonts/bvp.woff2&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">format</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;woff2&#x27;</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-display</span>: swap;\n  size-adjust: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>;      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* align metrics with the fallback */</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>4. Content injected above the reading position</strong> — a late notification or cookie bar pushing the page down. When one is unavoidable, use a <code>position: fixed</code> overlay rather than inserting into the flow.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> CLS <strong>is not measured only during load</strong>. Google counts shifts after interaction too (excluding the 500ms window right after user input). An accordion expanding is fine; a block that pops open on its own after three seconds is counted.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Measuring:</strong> Lighthouse for the lab, <code>web-vitals</code> plus Search Console for field data — the two numbers often differ noticeably.</p>","references":[{"label":"web.dev — Cumulative Layout Shift","url":"https://web.dev/articles/cls"},{"label":"web.dev — Optimize CLS","url":"https://web.dev/articles/optimize-cls"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/77-cascade-trong-css-nghia-la-gi","title":"Cascade trong CSS nghĩa là gì?"},{"url":"/q/79-inheritance-trong-css-la-gi","title":"Inheritance trong CSS là gì?"},{"url":"/q/80-don-vi-px-em-rem-vw-vh-khac-nhau","title":"Đơn vị px, em, rem, %, vw, vh khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/81-important-dung-khi-nao-tai-sao-nen-tranh","title":"!important dùng khi nào? Tại sao nên tránh?"},{"url":"/q/87-has-selector-la-gi","title":":has() selector là gì?"},{"url":"/q/88-combinator-selectors-space-khac-nhau","title":"Combinator selectors (>, +, ~, space) khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/90-is-where-not-khac-nhau","title":":is(), :where(), :not() khác nhau?"},{"url":"/q/91-box-model-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Box model gồm những gì?"}]}